  "answer_text": "Here is a comprehensive list of the **best free online auto repair estimate tools** available:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd27 Top Free Online Auto Repair Estimate Tools\n\n---\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfc6 [RepairPal](https://repairpal.com/estimator)\nRepairPal has been the #1 automotive industry estimator since 2008, developed by ASE-certified mechanics, and is trusted by millions of consumers and over 3,800 RepairPal Certified locations. The estimator brings together automotive industry standard data for parts pricing and labor times, combined with a proprietary labor rate model to deliver fair price ranges for common repairs. If the repair cost still exceeds the estimate range, they can intervene to work with the shop on your behalf or refund the difference \u2014 shops agree to honor the RepairPal Price Guarantee for 30 days after the repair is performed.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \ud83d\ude97 [Kelley Blue Book (KBB)](https://www.kbb.com/auto-repair/)\nKBB offers a free car repair estimator to find out what you should expect to pay for common auto repairs and maintenance. Estimating repair costs using their tool is one of the best and easiest ways to know how much you can expect to pay, based on what others have paid. This is a great option since KBB is one of the most trusted names in the automotive industry.\n\n---\n\n### 3. \ud83d\udd29 [YourMechanic](https://www.yourmechanic.com/estimates/)\nYourMechanic offers free instant auto repair and maintenance estimates, with a full price breakdown showing parts and labor. They have provided over 600,000 car repair estimates since 2012. You can choose from 600+ repair, maintenance, and diagnostic services backed by their 12-month, 12,000-mile warranty.\n\n---\n\n### 4. \ud83d\udede [NAPA Auto Care Repair Estimator](https://www.napaonline.com/en/auto-care/car-repair-estimator)\nNAPA's Auto Care Repair Estimator is a quick and easy way to get price estimates for the most common car repairs and routine maintenance services. It's backed by one of the most reputable auto parts brands in the country.\n\n---\n\n### 5. \ud83c\udfa8 [Maaco Online Estimator](https://www.maaco.com/online-estimator/) *(Auto Body & Paint)*\nMaaco offers a free online estimate specifically for auto body repair, painting, and collision repair services. This is ideal if you need body or paint work done.\n\n---\n\n### 6. \ud83d\udca5 [Instant Estimator](https://www.instantestimator.com/) *(Auto Body)*\nInstant Estimator is one of the original auto body damage estimating tools that also connects you to authorized auto body repair facilities in your area. Best of all, it's completely free.\n\n---\n\n### 7. \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f [Caliber Collision Online Estimate](https://www.caliber.com/online-estimate)\nCaliber provides a free initial online estimate for auto body and collision repair, auto glass services, and car repair. They offer the convenience of contactless repair estimates online.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips for Getting the Best Repair Estimate:\n- **Get multiple estimates** \u2014 compare at least 2\u20133 shops for the best price.\n- Once you know the estimated range of a typical repair using an online tool, you equip yourself with knowledge \u2014 while fixed costs like parts may not be negotiable, dealerships and repair shops will sometimes offer a break.\n- If it's a common repair or maintenance item, like an oil change, new brakes, or a tune-up, you can often find a promotion or coupon.\n- The best way to keep car repair costs low is to keep up with regular maintenance on your vehicle.",
